<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hi. Yup, older firmware had 1 second option. Does this have anything to do with scan speed? As newer fw takes slower scan speed than older with 1 sec option... In scanning sense, older fw somehow manages to go through active repeaters faster than newer.<br><br>I will send you a video, do you have any mail or fb contact?<br><br>S58sms 73</div></blockquote>That 1 sec to 2 secs was made on August 2021, because 1 secs was too short.<br>If you have a problem with scanning, you need to increase the <strong class="text-strong">Scan dwell</strong> time, that's the relevant setting.<br>Filter time as nothing to do here, as it's just involved once a TS lock is acquired, and in scanning mode, that timer is resetted each time a new channel is selected.<br><br>Cheers.<br>---<br>Daniel<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Mar 17, 2024 6:02 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
